ording to vrillon 1977 was on the  cusp of the upcoming age of aquarius  hippie's new age was big in the late 60s  and died out pretty soon after  whoever was behind it even if it was  aliens they were ten years  late to the party  but why aliens what do they have to do  with the new age movement and hippies  who's frillon and what's the ashtar  galactic command  you may have heard of the roswell  incident in mid-1947  a united states air force's balloon  crashed at a ranch near roswell new  mexico  eyewitnesses claimed to have seen a  flying saucer a ufo  that the u.s government were hiding from  the public ufos and aliens became the  next big thing  some even believed to be abducted by  aliens some even claimed to communicate  with them  and george van tassel in 1952 he claimed  to receive messages via telepathic  communication from an extraterrestrial  an interdimensional being called ashtar  and how did you did you go into this  ship i walked with him to a spot  underneath it  and an anti-gravity beam took me up  through a hole in the bottom of it  you're telling me at two o'clock in the  morning in giant rock airport you walked  underneath this hovering ship  of cuomo you went up into the single  guam oh you went just about as slow as a  local elevator and when you got off the  anti-gravity elevator  what did it look like i was inside of a  ship  about 18 feet in diameter and  roughly 10 feet high to the dome ceiling  and there were three men on the ship  besides the one that had got off and  invited me aboard  you keep calling a man what do you mean  man well  little green man they were about five  foot six  they came about to my eyebrows and uh  they  could have walked in our clothes down  any of our streets and we wouldn't have  paid any attention to them  what color were these people they looked  uh  like they were white people with a good  healthy pan  did they give you any indication of how  old they were or what they ate or where  they came from at all  